===== Specific Configuration =====

==== Network interfaces ====
The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description                  ^ Default configuration    ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WiFi                   | 192.168.1.1/24   |
| lan1-lan4        | LAN ports (1 to 4)           | None             |
| wlan0            | WiFi 2.4Ghz                  | Disabled         |
| wlan1            | WiFi 5Ghz                    | Disabled         |

==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====

In WAC104 is used DSA driver, so ports are visible as separate interfaces.

^ Port             ^ Switch port   ^
| LAN 1            | LAN1    |
| LAN 2            | LAN2     |
| LAN 3            | LAN3     |
| LAN 4            | LAN4     |

==== LEDs ====

How to configure LEDs in general, see the LED section in the [[docs:guide-user:base-system:led_configuration]].

The WAC104 has 7 LEDs:
^ LED name               ^ LED print   ^ Internal name       ^ Trigger                                   ^ Added information                                               ^
| Power                  | Power       | wac104:green:power  | N/A                                       | .                                                               |
| WiFi Protected Setup   | WPS         | r6220:green:wps     | N/A                                       | User preference, for example, set your 5Ghz wifi traffic here   |
| WiFi                   | WiFi        | wac104:green:wifi   | ''phy0tpt''                               | phy0 is 2.4Ghz, phy1 is 5.0Ghz                                  |
| LAN Port 1             | LAN1        | unknown             | N/A                                       | .                                                               |
| LAN Port 2             | LAN2        | unknown             | N/A                                       | .                                                               |
| LAN Port 3             | LAN3        | unknown             | N/A                                       | .                                                               |
| LAN Port 4             | LAN4        | unknown             | N/A                                       | .                                                               |

